+# N24 gripper-mode parent rescue: prospective Dev protocol
+
+Status: scientific design frozen before implementation. This document does not release GPU execution. CPU implementation, independent source/native-contract review, runtime admission and an exact source-bound execution release are still required. The ongoing user-authorized Arbor task continues; no new budget ceiling or protected-set permission is introduced.
+
+## Hypothesis and sole intervention
+
+The closed N23 result is REJECT by preregistered numeric futility, with24 accepted cells and N23 0/6 versus C0 1/6, Q0/N7 0/6. Its active clipping changed ranking but did not pass the task gate. Full-prefix command diagnostics show a different class of loss before actual parent supply. N24 tests that class. Positive gripper commands are command semantics, not proof of contact, closed fingers, grasp or utility.
+
+Direct parent is N23 at source `51104470983cdbafd08feb87f2f39b7553779405`; all N23 quality, N7 geometric descriptor/archive, N5 terminal selection, raw Stage binding and external providers remain byte/behavior-identical except minimal configuration/accounting/audit hooks for this intervention. N23 is a contemporaneous ablation, not a newly adopted best method. Historical-starting Q0 and P2/C0 remain controls.
+
+For each individual guided ED search:
+
+1. Create an empty local memory. After each already-scored canonical batch (initial iter=-1, then0..9), inspect native latent dimension10 at offsets0..7 using the existing decoder rule: value<0 maps to-1, otherwise+1. All eight positive is the fixed mode predicate. Nonfinite or identity mismatches fail closed. No fitted threshold or task/seed/label branch.
+2. Of mode-matching canonical candidates seen so far in this search, remember the smallest existing native effective cost and its full unmodified latent, descriptor/current frozen cell identity, paired quality/raw reward, source occurrence/fingerprint, source batch and context. Equal cost keeps the earliest canonical occurrence (batch order, then row); this is not a new score. Memory capacity is one canonical proposal, separate from and not inserted into the original spatial archive. No provider/projection/model re-evaluation is allowed to maintain it.
+3. Compute the original sixteen archive parents unchanged. If that actual allocated set already contains a mode-matching parent, or memory is empty, use the original set exactly. Otherwise substitute the remembered proposal at the first-index native maximum-cost allocated slot. Preserve order/identity of the other fifteen and update paired cost/quality/raw reward/cell/source metadata consistently. All other archive contents, replacement and sampling rules remain unchanged.
+4. Pass all sixteen actual parents through the original renoise/denoise/refinement path. There is no exact-survivor lane, candidate copying directly into the final scored population, forced gripper edit, extra proposal or guaranteed execution of the remembered action. RNG draw counts/order and model batch size remain the original ones. A remembered mode can still disappear during ED; this is measured, not hidden.
+5. After the final canonical batch, apply exactly the original N23/N5 final selection. Dispose of the local memory when the search returns or raises. It cannot cross a chunk, reset, Stage/target/source/guidance change or new observation. No new simulator/environment feedback is read.
+
+The memory never uses future candidates or an unexecuted action outcome. Canonical scoring of the current batch precedes an update that may affect only the following iteration. The spatial archive and original allocation must remain separately observable; do not relabel the substitution as an unmodified archive sample. Current N23 frozen descriptor bounds/context must be attested; store an existing descriptor/cell identity rather than compute an extra trajectory. Unsupported changing-bound/source contexts must fail closed, not silently reinterpret an old cache entry.
+
+## Fixed conditions and accounting
+
+Keep checkpoint, task definitions/success, init mappings, strict perturbation,720-step limit,20Hz,8-action execution, RDT decoder, images/observations, Stage/perception/prompt/caches and runtime fingerprints unchanged. Online Stage is exclusively current-account `codex_cli`, `auth_mode=chatgpt`, frozen `gpt-6-astra`/low/E2/180s. Never use Poe or a backend fallback; preserve existing Poe credentials without reading/copying them. Guidance and grounding retain frozen cached behavior. CLI-internal HTTP counts/retries remain Unknown, distinct from measured logical calls and token usage.
+
+Each complete guided search remains population16,10 refinement iterations,176 canonical candidate evaluations/11 score batches, with unchanged model/denoise/noise batch shapes and operations. Record memory checks, updates, substitutions, auxiliary wall time and all original model/reward/gradient/VLM/token/episode/GPU counters. No extra model/score batches, sampled probes, branch rollouts or learned components. Disabled and condition-inactive paths require exact parent/action/RNG parity with the parent.
+
+Native evidence must bind memory history to earlier canonical full latents, native costs/quality/raw rewards, fixed descriptor/cell context, fingerprints and every duplicate occurrence alias; prove the full8 predicate, earliest-minimum rule, actual pre-substitution parent mode absence, chosen first worst-cost slot, unchanged other15, and post-substitution parent-to-ED/terminal/decoded/executed/Stage accounting. A missing event or invalid source association is an invalid execution, not a mechanism success. Keep the pre-substitution archive allocation and post-substitution actual parent records distinct. Test synthetic corruption and default-off behavior; do not require an arbitrary minimum rescue count as a substitute for task performance.
+
+CPU preparation may use existing closed diagnostic JSON only for a labelled retrospective trigger screen after this rule is frozen. That screen may evaluate mode availability and substitution identities/costs, not new geometry, physical outcomes or an alternate success rate. It must include all139 decisions from the closed task0..3 summaries and disclose missing identities in the reused task0 summary; full raw decisions may be read only through a separately frozen minimal scope if needed. No task4/5 native expansion or protected data for implementation tuning.
+
+## Exact prospective comparison
+
+Forty primary cells, task-major0..9, arm order `C0,Q0,N23,N24`. Copy task/seed/init/science metadata from the original frozen N23 Dev plan `../n23_actuator_clipped_quality/plan.frozen.v2.gpu7.json` (acd2b2c639f7756cdc353b6a7eea8c93a4d735a8ce6ee25838d9502c938d07f0), change prospective cohort/attempt identities and profile-specific settings only. Use fresh attempts for all four contemporaneous arms; no old valid outcome is rerun into its old cell, replaced or pooled as an independent seed. This is exposed Dev reuse, not new-layout generalization. All C0/Q0 behavior must remain historical-parity controls; N23 must match its parent exactly.
+
+Promotion requires all40 accepted cells, N24 success>=5/10 and >=each contemporaneous C0,Q0,N23 total; valid runtime/data/selection/source/safety/QD/ED/compute evidence and complete required telemetry. Report per-task outcomes, gains/losses, all denominators/errors and costs before mechanism counters. A failure to outperform one task is not a posthoc veto; no task-specific subset is selected.
+
+After each complete audited quadruple only, stop for numeric futility if candidate successes + remaining tasks <5. Do not relabel a stopped prefix as a complete ten-task score. No valid task failure may be retried. Unsupported algorithm/numerical/safety/source/telemetry failures stop for INVALID/engineering review and remain charged.
+
+At most two whole-episode, same-science typed transport recoveries, at most one per cell, using the already frozen N23 sole-Codex-timeout classification: one call timed out with no completed turn/agent message, all other calls succeeded, complete explicitly chargeable failed-call telemetry and an accepted native audit. No favorable-response retry or fallback account/provider. Every old attempt/token/GPU cost remains. Recovery classification must be tested before release and cannot be widened after outcomes.
+
+## Finite resource envelope and gates
+
+No cumulative or bucket increase:478 attempts/100 GPUh, bucket caps baseline51/development187/validation180/formal40/recovery20. At N23 closure:261 used,37.30680221848908 GPUh, baseline39/development151/validation60/formal0/recovery11. Remaining baseline12/development36/recovery9 suffice for10 new baseline +30 new development +2 typed recoveries and, only if required by source review, one N24 native tensor preflight charged to recovery. Maximum43 dispatches including that one preflight;42 episode attempts maximum. No reuse/relaunch of the consumed N23 backend preflights.
+
+Local total GPU cap22h; episode timeout1800s plus40s cleanup; optional single native tensor preflight<=60s, no simulator/model/provider/Stage calls. CPU work uses2threads/CUDA-invisible guards until an explicit source-bound native preflight release. A failed native preflight is preserved and blocks the cohort; no automatic additional GPU preflight authorization. Remaining protected hours at closure are24.24082400243081 validation +12 formal, intact. Check all actual ledgers and live identities at admission; estimated spare capacity is not a reservation or permission to exceed ceilings. One private GPU7 worker at a time, existing UUID/boot/runtime admission and ACTIVE/PASS resource isolation; do not preempt another owner or modify its state.
+
+Validation and formal are closed. If Dev promotes, separately freeze a new untouched validation block pair using exposure identities,60 matched candidate/C0/Q0 episodes with candidate>=10/20 and>=controls, then the one fixed10-task formal candidate and compute-matched substantive-QD replacement ablation under unchanged goal/spec gates. Never tune on protected per-task outcomes. N23 conditional validation implementation remains inactive and cannot automatically authorize N24.
+
+Deliver source/config/protocol hashes, default-off tests, native source/accounting evidence, exact plans, immutable results and retained errors under this variant directory. Do not release GPU work from the CPU executor. Root reviews the concrete implementation and metered capacity, then issues the exact release within the existing user authorization.
